{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/BannerDiscord.png?t=1744034080\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner01Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the grim reality of life under fascism and the brave souls who dare to oppose it. Uncover the stories of the regime's victims through gripping crime investigations. At a crime scene, Johann stumbles upon a strange device, an artificial intelligence called <strong>&quot;Klara&quot;</strong>. Where does she come from? What are her intentions? Only one thing is clear: she wants to eliminate fascism <strong>- at <i>any</i> cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/mood.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner02Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Code: 9</strong>, you can examine every object in the crime scene. Experience unprecedented freedom and challenge on your hunt for evidence. <strong>No hand-holding, no markers</strong> - just you, the crime scene, and the cold, hard facts. Scour every detail, solve hidden puzzles, and uncover the truth about the victims\u2026 and the atrocities of the Nazis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/explore.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner03Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to think like a real detective? <strong>There\u2019s no guessing</strong> - you can only crack the case by using your own words. Analyze the evidence, name your findings, and deliver the right deductions. <strong>Prove why each fact matters</strong> in the murder investigation. Your reasoning decides the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/deduce.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner04Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in the final showdown and apply your logic against Nazis and regime supporters. Counter the statements of your opponents with your own words and use your discovered evidence - or deduce new facts from your opponents' statements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/argue.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/BigBannerEng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623630?t=1744034080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/0f362e6138d984c3264a906905b9656559ae66ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744034080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/73e782f36d736f16f004093b4872b1db465d524f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744034080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/73e782f36d736f16f004093b4872b1db465d524f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744034080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains explorations of crime scenes, general mature content and a sensitive theme."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/BannerDiscord.png?t=1744034080\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner01Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the grim reality of life under fascism and the brave souls who dare to oppose it. Uncover the stories of the regime's victims through gripping crime investigations. At a crime scene, Johann stumbles upon a strange device, an artificial intelligence called <strong>&quot;Klara&quot;</strong>. Where does she come from? What are her intentions? Only one thing is clear: she wants to eliminate fascism <strong>- at <i>any</i> cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/mood.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner02Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Code: 9</strong>, you can examine every object in the crime scene. Experience unprecedented freedom and challenge on your hunt for evidence. <strong>No hand-holding, no markers</strong> - just you, the crime scene, and the cold, hard facts. Scour every detail, solve hidden puzzles, and uncover the truth about the victims\u2026 and the atrocities of the Nazis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/explore.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner03Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to think like a real detective? <strong>There\u2019s no guessing</strong> - you can only crack the case by using your own words. Analyze the evidence, name your findings, and deliver the right deductions. <strong>Prove why each fact matters</strong> in the murder investigation. Your reasoning decides the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/deduce.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/Banner04Eng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in the final showdown and apply your logic against Nazis and regime supporters. Counter the statements of your opponents with your own words and use your discovered evidence - or deduce new facts from your opponents' statements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/argue.gif?t=1744034080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/BigBannerEng.png?t=1744034080\" /></p>","developers":["Riding Turtles"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/33d1ea9b3216266768c598cfb4facc59af829389/header.jpg?t=1744034080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122850,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122850/movie480.mp4?t=1744034078","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122850/movie